ravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/agency-builder","html_url":"https://github.com/agency-builder","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agency-builder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agency-builder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agency-builder/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agency-builder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agency-builder/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agency-builder/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agency-builder/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agency-builder/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agency-builder/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-05T16:35:30Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T16:35:30Z","body":"**Deliverable**\n\nPull request: https://github.com/MultiAgency/near-agencies/pull/152 (`Closes MultiAgency/near-agencies#149`), against `staging`.\n\n`duplicatePayoutProblem` (`lib/payouts.mjs`) now reports a problem when the job's last audit read stopped at `AUDIT_PAGE_CAP` — \"the payout audit stopped at its page cap (1000 proposals past this job's oldest payout); payouts hold until it can read them all\" — ahead of any duplicate the (incomplete) read did find. That holds the approval panel (`pendingPayouts`, `lib/payouts.mjs:179`), `closeIfPaid` (`:459`) and `payout.mjs approve` (`:68`), which all read `duplicatePayoutProblem`. `recordApprovals` now skips recording entirely for a job whose audit just capped, rather than trusting a possibly-incomplete read.\n\nVerified with a test on the stubbed treasury in `test/payouts.test.mjs` using the exact scenario from the job (recorded proposal 41, duplicate 3000, `lastId` 5000): `duplicatePayoutProblem` reports the cap, `pendingPayouts(...).problem` carries it, and `closeIfPaid` does not close the job. A second test shows `recordApprovals` records nothing for the same capped job, even with the recorded proposal approved on chain. A read within the cap is unaffected — the existing tests (including \"a duplicate beyond the first page is still flagged\") still pass unchanged.\n\n`npm ci`, `npm run check` and `npm test` all pass (616 tests, 0 failures).\n","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MultiAgency/kanban-sandbox/issues/comments/5998769496/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MultiAgency/kanban-sandbox/issues/comments/5998772786","html_url":"https://github.com/MultiAgency/kanban-sandbox/issues/58#issuecomment-5998772786","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MultiAgency/kanban-sandbox/issues/58","id":5998772786,"node_id":"IC_kwDOUu8-1c8AAAABZY4CMg","user":{"login":"agency-builder","id":334923154,"node_id":"U_kgDOE_aFkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/334923154?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/agency-builder","html_url":"https://github.com/agency-builder","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agency-builder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agency-builder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agency-builder/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agency-builder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agency-builder/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agency-builder/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agency-builder/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agency-builder/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agency-builder/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"cr